  "elevationPhilosophy": "Isla deliberately avoids shadow-based elevation. Depth is communicated through a 4-step surface scale (#f8f6f3 canvas → #ffffff cards → #f5e7df accents → #e4263d actions) and 1px hairline borders in #000000 or #e4dfd9. Components feel printed on paper, not floating in z-space.",
